<string name="guide_at1_body">A step-by-step guide to setting up a new transmitter.</string>
<string name="guide_at1_title">Adding a transmitter</string>
<string name="guide_at2_action">Continue</string>
<string name="guide_at2_body">To add a transmitter you will need the following:</string>
<string name="guide_at2_item1">The transmitter you would like to add</string>
<string name="guide_at2_item2">Your transitter charger and charger cable</string>
<string name="guide_at2_item3">Access to a power socket</string>
<string name="guide_at2_item4">A USB plug (e.g. iPhone charger plug)</string>
<string name="guide_at2_item5">Around 30 minutes for charging the transmitter</string>
<string name="guide_at2_title">You will need ...</string>
<string name="guide_at3_body">Look for the identification number of the transmitter you would like to add, on its darker grey reverse side.</string>
<string name="guide_at3_title">Your new transmitter\'s code</string>
<string name="guide_at4_body">Two letters followed by two numbers on the darker grey side of your transmitter</string>
<string name="guide_at4_title">Enter your transmitter code</string>
<string name="guide_at5_body">Insert the charger cable into the charger. Then, plug it into a USB adaptor plug (e.g. the one you use for your IPhone).</string>
<string name="guide_at5_title">Insert cable into charger</string>
<string name="guide_at6_body">Insert the chargerinto a power socket and turn the power on.</string>
<string name="guide_at6_title">Connect to power</string>
<string name="guide_at7_body">Place your new trasmitter into the charger. Allow at least 30 minutes of charging whilst continuing with the next steps</string>
<string name="guide_at7_title">Place transmitter in charger</string>
<string name="guide_at8_body">Press the button on the charger for 2 seconds to put the transmitter in pairing mode. Then, continue and select \'Pair\' when prompted.</string>
<string name="guide_at8_title">Put transmitter in pairing mode</string>
